const synergyDescriptions={"Corrosive Membrane":"Enemies that strike your body are burned by corrosive secretions.","Caustic Wake":"Moving quickly spreads a wider, more dangerous acid wake.","Living Armor":"After avoiding damage, your tissue grows a regenerating biological shield.","Contagious Division":"Your clones inherit your acid secretion and leave weaker corrosive trails.","Rapid Mitosis":"Your regenerative tissue accelerates the colony's mitotic recovery.","Predatory Colony":"Clone attacks inherit part of your evolved predatory power.","Barbed Tentacle":"Your pseudopod grows membrane spikes, increasing lash damage.","Caustic Tendril":"Your pseudopod deposits a burst of acid where it strikes.","Whiplash":"Flagella adaptations make the pseudopod snap substantially faster."};
